>> title: Ranch Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: buttermilk, herbs, salad, dip, no-cook
>> counters: Diner, Pizzeria, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: ranch, buttermilk ranch, side of ranch
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 10 min

>> step: whisk smooth
Whisk @mayonnaise{1/2%cup}(120 mL) with @sour cream{1/2%cup}(120 mL) and @buttermilk{1/2%cup}(120 mL) until smooth.

>> step: stir in
Stir @fresh dill{2%Tbs}(chopped), @chives{2%Tbs}(sliced thin), and @flat-leaf parsley{2%Tbs}(chopped) into @&(~1)base{}.

>> step: season
Season @&(~1)dressing{} with @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, @onion powder{1/2%tsp}, @kosher salt{1/2%tsp}, @black pepper{1/4%tsp}, and @lemon juice{1%tsp}.

>> step: chill 1 hr
Chill @&(~1)ranch{} for ~{1%hr} so the herbs bloom.
